   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "Cozy Designs Born from Love",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObroBd/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Cozy Designs Born from Love | Momcozy Official | Cozy Power By Momcozy | Momcozy Wellness 1 | Choose Your Perfect Pump Today | Heated Breast Pump | Breast Pump with Heat | Heated Wearable Breast Pump | Momcozy® Official | Momcozy® Pumping Options | Momcozy® With Moms Always | Heating Pad Breast Pumping | Breast Pump that Heats Up | Perfect for Busy Mothers | Pump Smarter with Heat | Heat helps improve milk flow and reduces discomfort while pumping. | Designed for comfort & convenience. Trusted by 4.5M+ moms worldwide | Learn how heated pumps support faster let-down and better output. | Discover a more comfortable and efficient pumping experience.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObroBd/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 删除 safest/100% safe/zero risk/perfect 等虚假安全承诺，以及 fits all breast shapes/one size fits all/一定不损伤/适合所有胸型等绝对化适配承诺（best/#1/No.1 排名最高级已放开） ▸ 奶流/移除量/排空效率/漏奶/短时排乳类claim需W1自身对照数据（样本、对照、统计口径齐全），或改为放松叙事+限定语（may help/natural）；内部测试数值（28.2%/10%/70%）补齐前不得公开传播",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObroBd/修改建议"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "命中原因",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；H05 虚假安全承诺（best/#1/No.1/最佳/最好等排名最高级按2026-09-09口径放开，海外广告允许，不再判险）；M07 效率/漏奶/奶流/移除量/短时排乳类claim需W1自身对照数据（当前仅内部测试或外部研究，28.2%/10%/70%待补样本与统计），或限定为放松叙事；未补证据前需限定或删除",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObroBd/命中原因"
  },
